ted 83 bytes>\nore falls below a threshold, the item is blocked. Also if one of the brands is in the family, yet is still below the threshold, it is considered no match.\n\n\nThe brand matching logic has two main components: an initial letter check and a similarity score. The similarity score filter seems problematic, particularly given how string similarity scores behave with potential OCR errors or differences in transliteration. Additionally, the strength extraction function converts \"جم\" (grams) to milligrams even when it likely represents a common typo for \"مجم\" (mg) in tablet/capsule contexts, potentially leading to incorrect values.\n\nI'm considering how to correct the brand matching. The goal is to retain the filter if possible; thus, I'll explore modifying the similarity score calculation or the \"جم\" to \"مجم\" conversion to reduce false negatives. The goal is an increased count.\n\n\nThe plan is to address the filtering issue without hardcoding specific substance names, aiming for a count increase to approximately 130-134. Modifications will involve adjusting the similarity score or fixing the \"جم\" to \"مجم\" conversion in the brand matching logic. Before any code changes, the current state requires explicit confirmation. A separate task is to create an MD file with a system architecture diagram.\n\n\nA new Markdown file named `SYSTEM_ARCHITECTURE_GRAPH.md` will be created. The file will be placed in the project root and as an artifact. The architecture document will include a system overview describing the intelligent system for matching pharmacy drug shortages with warehouse lists, incorporating algorithmic filtering and generative AI (Gemini 3.8 Flash). It will also contain a system architecture diagram.\n\nThe architecture diagram will outline the system's layers: Input/Reading (PDF/Excel ingestion), Preprocessing/Fast Indexing (TF-IDF + Trigram Search), and a Pharmaceutical Decision Graph with three levels of matching: Exact Match, Deterministic Auto-Match with pharmaceutical rules. I'll need to define level 3.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"ArtifactMetadata":"{\"RequestFeedback\":false,\"Summary\":\"Comprehensive System Architecture and Decision Graph documentation in Arabic with Mermaid diagrams.\",\"UserFacing\":true}","CodeContent":"\"# نظام مطابقة نواقص الأدوية الذكي — Pharmacy Intelligent Matcher\\n## المخطط المعماري الشامل وشجرة اتخاذ القرار (System Architecture & Decision Graph)\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 1. نظرة عامة على النظام (System Overview)\\n\\nنظام هجين فائق الدقة والسرعة مخصص للصيدليات والشركات الطبية، يقوم بمطابقة طلبات وقوائم نواقص الأدوية (Shortages) الواردة بصيغ متعددة (Excel / PDF) مع عروض وقوائم مخازن الأدوية والموزعين (Warehouse Catalogs).\\n\\nيعتمد النظام على **هيكلية متدرجة متعددة المستويات (Multi-Tier Decision Pipeline)** تجمع بين:\\n1. **الفهرسة الحتمية والبحث الدلالي السريع (TF-IDF & N-Gram Search)** في أجزاء من الثانية.\\n2. **القواعد الصيدلانية الصارمة (Deterministic Pharmaceutical Rules)** التي تمنع أي تداخل دوائي أو خطأ علاجي.\\n3. **الذكاء الاصطناعي التوليدي الصيدلاني (Gemini 3.8 Flash)** عبر دفعات مجمعة (Batch Processing) لمعالجة التصحيف اللغوي وتشوهات الـ OCR المعقدة.\\n4. **حواجز الأمان الصيدلاني البعدية (Safety Guardrails)** لضمان صفر أخطاء تجارية (Zero False Positives).\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 2. المخطط المعماري العام للنظام (System Architecture)\\n\\n```mermaid\\nflowchart TD\\n    subgraph Inputs[\\\"1. طبقة المدخلات واستخراج البيانات (Ingestion Layer)\\\"]\\n        F1[\\\"ملف النواقص<br/>(Excel: 0913.xlsx)\\\"]\\n        F2[\\\"ملفات عروض المخازن<br/>(PDFs / Excel)\\\"]\\n        OCR[\\\"محرك الاستخراج الذكي<br/>Unstructured API + OCR\\\"]\\n        F1 --> EXT1[\\\"استخراج أسماء الأصناف وتنظيفها\\\"]\\n        F2 --> OCR --> EXT2[\\\"استخراج جداو\n<truncated 8402 bytes>","Description":"\"Comprehensive System Architecture and Decision Graph documentation in Arabic\"","Overwrite":"true","TargetFile":"\"D:\\\\AI_Engineer\\\\Pharmacy-agy\\\\SYSTEM_ARCHITECTURE_GRAPH.md\"","toolAction":"\"Create architecture documentation\"","toolSummary":"\"Write SYSTEM_ARCHITECTURE_GRAPH.md\""}}],"truncated_fields":["thinking","tool_calls"]}
